<title>LITHUANIA: AVERAGE GROSS SALARY FALLS IN APRIL.</title>
<headline>AVERAGE GROSS SALARY FALLS IN APRIL.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average gross salary fell in April to 751 litas from 753 litas, the statistics department said on Monday.</p>
<p>It added in a statement that the average gross salary in the public sector in April was down to 779 litas compared to 802 litas in March.</p>
<p>The average gross salary in the country's private sector rose to 706 litas in April compared to 678 litas in March, it added.</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom.</p>
</text>
